   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# 1 - H3 text to video / image to video\n\n**Models** (official Comfy-Org files; the loaders carry their download links): fl2va diffusion model, Qwen3-VL text encoder, video + audio VAE.\n\n**Checkpoint variants**: the bf16 checkpoints work in the same loaders (pick them in the list); the Turbo LoRA (4-step ref2v / 8-step fl2v) cuts the steps - set the scheduler steps to match.\n\n**Inputs**: a prompt; optionally a first frame and / or a last frame (any size: the first frame is stretched to the canvas, the last frame cover-cropped - core's rules).\n\n**Controls**: Bypass `first frame` (Ctrl+B) for text to video; enable `last frame` for first + last frame. Length snaps to 17k+5 frames (124 = 5.2 s at 24 fps). Turbo LoRA: enable it and set steps to 8.\n\n**Output**: an MP4 with picture and generated sound in output/h3_tasks/.\n\n**Limits**: trained range ~124-362 frames; longer is untested by MiniMax (use workflow 8 for long video).\n\n**Status**: built in ComfyUI's own front end and validated by the server (only missing model / media files reported). NOT run on H3 weights on the build machine - starting values follow core's H3 templates (res_multistep, simple, 20 steps, guider cfg 1). Guide: workflows/tasks/README.md."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "# 1 - H3 text to video / image to video\n\n**Models** (official Comfy-Org files; the loaders carry their download links): fl2va diffusion model, Qwen3-VL text encoder, video + audio VAE.\n\n**Checkpoint variants**: the bf16 checkpoints work in the same loaders (pick them in the list); the Turbo LoRA (4-step ref2v / 8-step fl2v) cuts the steps - set the scheduler steps to match.\n\n**Inputs**: a prompt; optionally a first frame and / or a last frame (any size: the first frame is stretched to the canvas, the last frame cover-cropped - core's rules).\n\n**Controls**: Bypass `first frame` (Ctrl+B) for text to video; enable `last frame` for first + last frame. Length snaps to 17k+5 frames (124 = 5.2 s at 24 fps). Turbo LoRA: enable it and set steps to 8.\n\n**Output**: an MP4 with picture and generated sound in output/h3_tasks/.\n\n**Limits**: trained range ~124-362 frames; longer is untested by MiniMax (use workflow 8 for long video).\n\n**Status**: built in ComfyUI's own front end and validated by the server (only missing model / media files reported). NOT run on H3 weights on the build machine - starting values follow core's H3 templates (res_multistep, simple, 20 steps, guider cfg 1). Guide: workflows/tasks/README.md."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
